{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Yozakura Quartet: Hoshi no Umi","An OVA based on the Hoshi no Umi arc of the manga spanning chapters 26-34. \n\r\n\n\r\nThis arc focuses on Rin Azuma, a Jiang-Shi yokai resident of Sakurashin adjusting to her new life in the city and working for a ramen shop. One day her former friend Zakuro Kurumaki invades Sakurashin to capture Rin and convince her to join her in destroying the city with the other yokai hunters as well as Enjin Hiizumi, the main antagonist of the series. Akina Hiizumi and the other members of the Hiizumi Life Counseling Office take action to save Rin, 'tune' the yokai controlling Zakuro and protect the city.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["夜桜四重奏 ～ホシノウミ～",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-8457","ids":{"shikimori":8457,"mal":8457,"anilist":8457,"kodik":"serial-25980"},"kodikIds":["serial-5428","serial-23397","serial-25980"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-5428":"2019-12-03T08:01:55Z","serial-23397":"2020-03-05T16:33:07Z","serial-25980":"2020-05-23T02:23:59Z"},"title":"Вишнёвый квартет: Звёздный океан","originalTitle":"Yozakura Quartet: Hoshi no Umi","alt":"Квартет Сакуры: Океан звёзд / Квартет ночной Сакуры: Океан звёзд / Вишнёвый квартет: океан звёзд 夜桜四重奏 ～ホシノウミ～","description":"В городе ёкаев, Сакурасине, снова незваные гости. На этот раз — некромант Дзакуро Курумаки . Её цель — найти и вернуть свою давнюю подругу Рин Адзуму .","year":2010,"type":"OVA","genres":["Сёнен","Экшен","Комедия","Фэнтези","мифология","городское фэнтези"],"rating":7.37,"popularity":11359,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/8457/f13f4b06137c7efb0244fe772df2e0ac.jpeg","width":225,"height":350},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/8457-iOJnFK1vWBUA.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-609","dubId":"609","labe